infographic sequence-timeline-simple
data
  title Graceful shutdown, done right
  desc Drain before you die — all inside the grace window before SIGKILL
  sequences
    - label Readiness probe fails
      desc Pod leaves the load-balancer rotation, so new requests stop arriving
    - label SIGTERM arrives
      desc Nest fires teardown only if enableShutdownHooks() registered the listener
    - label Stop accepting new work
      desc The HTTP adapter stops the server while in-flight responses keep running
    - label Drain in-flight requests
      desc Wait for open responses; forceCloseConnections kills idle Keep-Alive sockets
    - label Release resources
      desc onApplicationShutdown closes the pool, consumers and clients in reverse order
    - label Process exits
      desc Finish within terminationGracePeriodSeconds (default 30s) before an untrappable SIGKILL
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
